Description: Fast biometric facial authentication for Linux via dedicated IR camera
 A high-performance, secure biometric facial authentication system for Linux,
 designed as a native equivalent to Windows Hello. Powered by Rust, OpenCV DNN
 acceleration, YuNet & SFace models, and Debian PAM integration.

